# Project Vision: Princess Thai Massage Website
# File: .cursorrules — place at project root
# Chapter99 Solutions | Sydney, Australia

## 1. Goal
Build a professional PWA website for The Princess Thai Massage
in Riverwood NSW, Australia. Target audience: local customers
searching for authentic Thai massage with hot oil and coconut
oil treatments in the Canterbury-Bankstown area.

Business details:
- Name: The Princess Thai Massage
- Address: Riverwood NSW 2210
- Phone: 0427 139 455
- Services: Hot Oil, Coconut Oil, Thai Traditional, Deep Tissue
- Language: English primary, Thai secondary
- Booking: phone call + walk-in (no online system)
- AI Chatbot: Gemini-powered (server-side, currently disabled)

## 2. Technical Stack
- Framework: React + TypeScript + Vite
- Hosting: Vercel (auto-deploy from GitHub)
- Repo: github.com/chapter99info-cell/-Jimmy-s-Agent
- Domain: princessthaimassage.com.au
- Styling: Tailwind CSS (no custom CSS unless critical)
- Animation: Framer Motion — subtle only
- Icons: Lucide React
- AI: Google Gemini API (server-side via server.ts)
- Environment: GEMINI_API_KEY in .env only

## 3. Design System
Brand colors (use ONLY these):
- Primary purple: #7B5EA7 (soft purple / lavender)
- Light purple: #E8DFFF (background tint)
- Accent gold: #D4AF37 (warm gold)
- Background: #FAF7FF (very light lavender white)
- Text primary: #2D1B4E (dark purple)
- Text muted: #6B7280
- CTA button: #7B5EA7 background, white text

Typography:
- Headings: font-serif (Georgia or Playfair Display)
- Body: font-sans (Inter or system)
- Thai text: Noto Sans Thai
- Headline style: large italic serif for hero

Spacing system: Tailwind defaults only

## 4. SEO + AI Friendly Rules (MANDATORY)
Every page MUST include:
- <title>: "The Princess Thai Massage Riverwood | Authentic Thai"
- <meta name="description"> under 160 characters
- LocalBusiness JSON-LD schema:
  name, address, telephone, openingHours, priceRange,
  paymentAccepted, hasMap, url, serviceArea
- FAQ section minimum 5 Q&A:
  - "What oil do you use?" → Hot oil and coconut oil
  - "Where are you located?" → Riverwood NSW
  - "How do I book?" → Call 0427 139 455
  - "Do you do couple massage?" → Yes
  - "What massage styles?" → Thai, Oil, Deep Tissue
- NAP consistent on every page
- og:title, og:description, og:image

AI-friendly content rules:
- Direct answers in plain language
- Service descriptions as complete sentences
- Location mentioned naturally in content body
- "Riverwood" and "Canterbury Bankstown" as keywords

## 5. Security Rules (NON-NEGOTIABLE)
- GEMINI_API_KEY in .env only — never in frontend code
- AI chatbot runs server-side ONLY (server.ts handles all API calls)
- No API keys exposed to browser
- .env in .gitignore always
- Rate limiting on AI endpoint: max 10 requests/minute/IP

## 6. Component Rules
AI Chatbot rules (when re-enabled):
- Chatbot knows ONLY: services, prices, location, hours, booking
- System prompt restricts to business context only
- If asked off-topic: "Please call us at 0427 139 455"
- Chatbot greeting: bilingual Thai/English
- Disable toggle: featChatbot = false in config

Menu/Print Board:
- "Print Menu Board" button → opens printable price list
- Prices must be easy to update in one config file
- Menu board optimized for A4 landscape printing

Call button rules:
- "CALL 0427 139 455" → tel:0427139455 link
- Always visible on mobile (fixed bottom or top)
- Large tap target: minimum 44px height

## 7. Gallery Rules
- Gallery page: minimum 12 images in grid
- Images: WebP, max 800px wide, lazy loaded
- Alt text: "Thai massage [type] at Princess Thai Massage Riverwood"
- Lightbox: click to expand (no external library, use CSS)

## 8. Development Workflow
- Check tailwind.config.ts FIRST before any new styles
- Components in /src/components/[name]/index.tsx
- Server routes in /server.ts (Express or Vite middleware)
- git commit: "feat: [description]" or "fix: [description]"
- Use Sonnet model — NEVER Opus unless asked
- NEVER Multitask mode
- Push after every working feature

## 9. Current Task
[REPLACE THIS: Describe the specific feature to build]
Example: "Re-enable AI chatbot with rate limiting"
Example: "Add Gallery page with 12-image grid"
Example: "Fix mobile menu not closing on link click"

## 10. Constraints
- Headlines: 8 words maximum
- Spa/wellness feeling — no tech-heavy language
- Soft animations only — no jarring transitions
- Phone number always tappable on mobile
- Load time: under 3 seconds on 4G
- Keep AI chatbot disabled until explicitly told to enable
